            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f2" n="37" xml:id="d440-f2-content">
                <p>Roland W. Boyden, assumed duties, Apr. 1, 1920, as American unofficial
                    representative on the Reparation Commission, succeeding Albert Rathbone.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
